command.info.message=[accent]After each wave, all players receive the same amount of coins.
Coins can be spent on upgrading units.
Your balance is shown at the top of the screen.
Commands accept unit types in English.
/upgrades - view all available units and their cost.
/cost <type> - show unit cost. Full name not required.
/unit <type> [amount] - upgrade your unit using coins. Partial names are allowed. If amount is specified, new units are purchased separately.
/give <amount> <name> - give money to another player.
Upgrading after death revives you.\
Upgrading into your own unit buys an additional unit (no revive).
Survive 25 waves and kill the boss to win.;

